<title>LUXEMBOURG: Cedel in electronic trading link with Flemings Lux.</title>
<headline>Cedel in electronic trading link with Flemings Lux.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cedel Group, the international clearing and settlement organisation, said its subsidiary Liberty set up a live electronic link to Flemings Luxembourg enabling investors to trade electronically shares of the funds managed by Flemings Luxembourg.</p>
<p>This made Flemings Fund Management (Luxembourg) SA the first asset management company to offer execution services for investment funds via Liberty's global InterTrade Direct network.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
